SF0042 Resort hotel liquor licenses.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Gierau and Barlow and Representative(s)
Byron and Wylie
AN ACT relating to alcoholic beverages; authorizing resort hotel liquor
licenses; specifying requirements for the resort hotel liquor license and
licensees; making conforming amendments; providing and amending definitions;
and providing for an effective date.
